.TH SALAK 1 "October 2026" "Salak 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
salak \- lightweight Markdown reader
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B salak
.RB [ \-\-theme
.IR FILE ]
.RI [ PATH ]
.br
.B salak
.RB ( \-h " | " \-V )
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B salak
is a read\-only Markdown reader. It shows the Markdown files of a folder in a
tree and renders the selected one in a tab.
.PP
If
.I PATH
is a folder, it is browsed. If it is a file, it is opened and its folder is
browsed. Without
.IR PATH ,
a welcome page offers to open a file or a folder.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-theme " FILE"
Use
.I FILE
as the theme instead of the default one (see
.BR FILES ).
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Print the usage and exit.
.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-version
Print the version and exit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/salak/theme.ini
The theme: an INI file setting colors for the light and dark modes, fonts, the
font size and the width of the text. It defaults to
.I ~/.config/salak/theme.ini
and is applied again at every save. See Help, Theming Guide, in the application.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B XDG_CONFIG_HOME
Folder of the configuration, instead of
.IR ~/.config .
.TP
.BR SWAYSOCK ", " I3SOCK ", " HYPRLAND_INSTANCE_SIGNATURE
When one of them is set, a tiling window manager is assumed and the window
has no decorations.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.B 2
on invalid arguments or a missing path.
.SH SEE ALSO
Project page:
.UR https://github.com/tiziolabs/salak
.UE
